\title{convmoment: Generalized Binomial Moment Transformations Across Arbitrary Origins}
\description{
Implements the generalized binomial framework for transforming statistical moments of any order across arbitrary origins. Provides a unified method for raw-to-raw, raw-to-central, and central-to-raw moment conversions using a single origin-shift parameter b = a - k and the symbolic binomial operator (a + b)^r with a^j -> mu'_j(a). Includes functions for moment transformation, direct moment computation from data, and validation against theoretical distributions (Binomial, Normal).
}
